  <h1>CMD Navigator</h1>
  <p>
    For my graduation project, I designed the CMD Navigator, a mobile-first app
    that helps first-year CMD students find their way within the program.
  </p>
  <p>
    The app acts as a visual layer next to the existing learning platforms,
    showing how courses, skills, terms and resources are connected. Through
    flows like Discover, Search and Compass, students can quickly understand
    where they are, what they are working towards and how everything fits
    together.
  </p>
  <p>
    My process included research, concept development, prototyping and
    validation with students, teachers and stakeholders.
  </p>
